Why This Is Asked

This question probes dynamic module loading, cross-process IPC, and secure update delivery—key in scalable Android architectures. It tests practical design choices under constraints like sandboxing, memory budgets, and rollback safety.

Key Concepts

- Dynamic Dex/plugin loading in a sandboxed process
- IPC surfaces (Binder/AIDL) for UI components
- Module discovery, versioning, and rollback
- Security: signatures, Play Integrity, secure remote config
- Resource budgeting and lifecycle management

